abstract: >-
  Public-record consolidation of the GRUT research program at source boundary
  master-w25bu9 @ 6abbf316 (25 September 2026). Reports what the program has
  constructed within declared model classes, the explicit inventory of
  supplied primitive inputs, the unresolved seams, and every preserved failed
  pre-registered gate. In-house record: no external peer review, no
  experimental validation, and no confirmed novel quantitative prediction is
  claimed.
